---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About us — RAD DESIGNZ" description="RAD DESIGNZ is an independent design studio working on brand identity, logo design, packaging and creative direction.">
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>About us</h2></div>
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <p class="lede">
            RAD DESIGNZ is an independent design studio working on brand identity,
            logo design, creative direction and packaging.
          </p>
          <p>
            The name traces back to Radji, short for Ridjimiraril — a character in
            Rolf de Heer&rsquo;s <em>Ten Canoes</em>, the first feature film shot entirely in
            Australian Aboriginal languages. It is a story told inside another story,
            where how the tale is told carries as much weight as what happens in it.
            That is close to how we think about brands.
          </p>
          <p>
            Since 2017 we have built identities, packaging, campaigns and product
            interfaces for Samsung, STA Travel, Arable Protocol, Menspire and many
            other brands, alongside startups, sports organisations and independent
            businesses.
          </p>
          <p>
            We also produce AI-assisted film under RAD SEQUENCE FILMS. Our short
            <em>The Ash Witness</em> was an official selection at the Runway AI Film
            Festival 2026.
          </p>
          <p>Based in Germany. Working in English and Romanian.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="panel">
          <h3>What we do</h3>
          <ul class="svc">
            <li>Brand identity</li>
            <li>Logo</li>
            <li>Packaging</li>
            <li>Creative direction</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
